  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the house shall match those used in 139 Brabazon Road.",
    "Condition : 5 - Before the development is commenced a scheme for protecting the proposed residential accommodation from excessive external noise shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and any works which form part of such a scheme shall be completed before any part of the development is first occupied or used.",
    "Condition : 6 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises or any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 7 - A splay of 2.4m X2.4 m shall be provided on each side of each access, the depth measured from the back of the footway and the widths outwards from the edges of the access and no fence, wall or other obstruction to visibility exceeding 0.6m in height above the surface of the adjoining highway shall be erected within the areas of such splays. The boundary wall shall be reinstated except at the point of access.",
    "Condition : 8 - The vehicular crossovers hereby permitted to the front of 108 Brabazon Road and the proposed development shall have a maximum width of 3.6 metres.",
    "Condition : 9 - The dwelling as proposed shall not be occupied until space has been laid out within the rear garden for two off-street parking space.",
    "Condition : 10 - The forecourt to be laid out as garden and a low front wall is to be provided."
  ],
